      "answer": "**Transformer 1 @ MAIN \u2014 data completeness, 2024-01-15T00:00:00 to 2024-01-19T00:00:00 (exclusive)**\n\nThe window covers 4 calendar days (Jan 15, 16, 17, 18); the stream samples once daily at 00:00.\n\n| Channel | Non-null count | First timestamp with data | Last timestamp with data | Days with no sample | Verdict |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| acetylene | 4 | 2024-01-15T00:00:00 | 2024-01-18T00:00:00 | none | **usable** |\n| co | 4 | 2024-01-15T00:00:00 | 2024-01-18T00:00:00 | none | **usable** |\n\nBoth channels have exactly 4 non-null samples (one per day, zero nulls), meeting the \u22654 threshold, so no fallback is required.\n\nHydrogen fallback: not needed, but for reference it also has 4 non-null samples (2024-01-15 \u2192 2024-01-18, no missing days) and would have been a valid substitute.",
